// What the saved guide pages say about how an item combines with others (ticket 124), in the planner's own words:
// `rules::ItemInteractions`, at most one note per item. Only items an agent run showed two summaries weren't enough
// for, and "the guide doesn't say" where it doesn't. `describe` shows the note.
[
    (item: SelectionOption("azata/superpowers/favorable-magic"), interactions: "With Persistent Spell: the guide doesn't say whether both apply (two rolls, then a second save) or one replaces the other."),
    (item: Feat("metamagic-persistent-spell"), interactions: "With Favorable Magic: the guide doesn't say whether both apply (two rolls, then a second save) or one replaces the other."),
    (item: MythicFeat("expanded-arsenal"), interactions: "The guide speaks of the bonuses of all Spell Focus feats for another school, so Spell Focus, Greater Spell Focus and Spell Focus (Mythic) of that school all count, from one school only; it does nothing in a school with Spell Focus feats of its own. The guide doesn't say which school counts when several have them: the caster line takes the one that adds most."),
    (item: MythicAbility("second-bloodline"), interactions: "The second bloodline comes with all its benefits, its arcana included: the guide's note on Draconic bloodlines (two of them would double the arcana's damage) shows a second bloodline's arcana counts. The caster line adds the Fey and Infernal arcana held through it."),
    (item: MythicAbility("bloodline-ascendance"), interactions: "The guide gives the 20th-level ability of your bloodline and doesn't say which one a character with two bloodlines (Second Bloodline, Crossblooded) gets. The planner grants each held bloodline's 20th-level ability."),
    (item: SelectionOption("sorcerer/bloodline/fey"), interactions: "Fey Arcana's +2 to compulsion DCs: the guide gives it no bonus type and doesn't say whether it stacks with School Power or Spell Focus (School Power says it stacks with Spell Focus). The caster line adds every DC bonus held."),
    (item: SelectionOption("sorcerer/bloodline/infernal"), interactions: "Infernal Arcana's +2 to charm DCs: the guide gives it no bonus type and doesn't say whether it stacks with School Power or Spell Focus (School Power says it stacks with Spell Focus). The caster line adds every DC bonus held."),
]
